<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Gen Accident cut by Warburg.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Gen Accident cut by Warburg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts at SBC Warburg cut their rating on General Accident stock to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;add&quot; on Tuesday after recent strong gains in the share price and following the group's first quarter profits, dealers said.</p>
</text>
